[
  // Herblore prepares organic material without changing what it is: dried emberleaf is still
  // emberleaf, only drier, more concentrated and no longer rotting. That is the whole line
  // between this profession and Alchemy, and it is visible in the outputs — every prepared
  // reagent keeps its source's signature property and sheds water, bulk and decay.
  //
  // The wild-gathering actions that used to live here moved to Farming in the 20-profession
  // pass. Herblore now buys its inputs from Farming, Hunting/Beast Lore and Forestry.
